{
  "job_B1.3.35_20251001_193219": {
    "chunk_text": "suman leohtes, swi\u00f0e afyrhte for \u00feam \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe se halga wer, of \u00feam heofonlican leohte ne beo ge afyrhte. Ic heom nu gefrefrod mid engellicre \u00feenunge. Ga\u00f0 in & sceawia\u00f0 hu me is. Ge gebrohten me on \u00ferystum, & ic blissige nu on leohte; mine bendas sund tolysede, & ic blissige mid Ic eom nu gestrangod & hnesce understreowod. Wundria\u00f0 \u00feises, \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00fee wur\u00f0a\u00fe God mid so\u00fere andetnesse, \u00fe\u00e6t he sigef\u00e6st by\u00fe \u00e6fre. Cy\u00fea\u00fe nu ardlice eowerum arleasan hlaforde hwilces leohtes ic bruce, & hwilcere beddinge, \u00fe\u00e6t he His mildheortednesse ane ic me ondr\u00e6de swi\u00f0ost, \u00fe\u00e6t he beo awend swilce he wille me gemilscian. Hi cyddon \u00fea \u00feis \u00feam hetolan cwellere, & he wear\u00f0 geangsumod on his mode & \u00e6bl\u00e6ce on nebbe Bera\u00f0 hine nu, ic bidde, ut of \u00feam blindan cw\u00e6rterne to suman softan bedde \u00fe\u00e6t he mage swa hine Nelle ic hine wyrcan wuldorfulran gyt, gif he on \u00feam witum gewitnod ateora\u00f0. Hi hine namon and \u00fea b\u00e6ran bli\u00feelice on \u00e6armun \u00fee hine \u00e6r witnodon on \u00feam w\u00e6lhreowum & hi his fet cystun, & his flowende blod geornlice gaderoden him sylfum to h\u00e6le, & geleddon hine Hit gelamp \u00fea sona \u00e6fter litlum fyrstum, \u00fe\u00e6t se halga diacon gewat of worlde to Gode mid Datianus \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00fe, se deofollica cweller\u00e6,",
